irst dose of COVID-19 vaccine was calculated by race and ethnicity.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"To dichotomize counties as urban versus rural, four of these six categories\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All analyses were conducted using SAS software (version 9.4; SAS Institute).\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}